    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      357.96,
      286.88,
      482.72
    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 7 My No.: Bala/2/1/4/11. Land Ministry\u2019s No.: LD/05/2001/PC/384. I hereby give notice under Sub - section (1) of the Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/ servitude* which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.04,
      484.15,
      274.44,
      505.75
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      507.19,
      286.66,
      620.76
    ],
    "text": "The Land called Maradanawatta extent about 0.0017 Hectare depicted as Lots 01 and 02 in the Surveyor General\u2019s Plan of P.P.G. 4292 of 14.11.2017 situated in 88 A Kandegoda Grama Niladhari Division in Balapitiya Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Galle District. Boundaries as follows: 01. Lot No. 01\u2013 Maradanawatta - 0.0016 Hectare",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      620.95,
      286.91,
      656.23
    ],
    "text": "North: Maradanawatta claimed by L.A.P.K. De Silva; East: Maradanawatta claimed by L.A.P.K. De Silva; South: Kandegoda Devata Road; West: Kandegoda Devata Road.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      346.64,
      539.92,
      391.28
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 02 - Maradanawatta - 0.0001 Hactare North: Kandegoda Devata Road; East: Kandegoda Devata Road; South: Maradanawatta claimed by W. Janak Wasantha; West: Maradanawatta claimed by W. Janak Wasantha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      392.72,
      542.24,
      547.99
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/ lands on which a servitude is to be acquired* are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat of Balapitiya on the 11 day of July 2018 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 04 day of July 2018 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/ servitude*, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      549.44,
      539.64,
      642.56
    ],
    "text": "B.P.S. ANURADHI, Divisional Secretary , Balapitiya. 03th April, 2018.",
